This repository is a modification of Call of Duty 2. Several files are
derived from Infinity Ward / Activision game scripts and assets and remain
the property of their respective owners. They are included only so the mod
can be built and used with a legally owned copy of Call of Duty 2. This
includes, but is not limited to:

  back2uo/z_svr_back2uo_2.1/maps/**            (stock gametype, utility and map FX scripts, modified)
  back2uo/z_svr_back2uo_2.1/codescripts/**     (stock script)
  back2uo/z_back2uo_2.1_client/ui_mp/**        (stock menu files, modified)
  back2uo/z_back2uo_2.1_client/weapons/**      (stock weapon definitions, modified)
  back2uo/localized_*_iw15/localizedstrings/*  (except back2uomod.str)

The MIT License applies only to the original Back2Uo work (back2uo/z_svr_back2uo_2.1/back2uo/**,
